{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Nano Neighbors  - Desktop Idle Game!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590780/extras/TalkGif.gif?t=1742506224\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the future, NanoCorp revolutionized society with the creation of NANOs\u2014advanced androids designed to work, protect, and evolve. But their greatest discovery wasn\u2019t in circuits or code\u2014it was in connection</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> A NANO\u2019s true potential is unlocked through its Handler, forming a bond that fuels its growth and efficiency. To ensure their world prospers, NanoCorp pairs every NANO with a dedicated Handler, fostering companionship that strengthens both. The closer the bond, the greater the NANO thrives\u2014and in turn, so does their society</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a Handler. You have to form a bond with your NANO!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590780/extras/FitGirl_loop_300.gif?t=1742506224\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customise your NANO, their capsule home, meet up with friends &amp; relax while you work or do anything on the desktop :))</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590780/extras/Screenshot_2025-03-08_at_1.02.07_AM.png?t=1742506224\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3590780?t=1742506224","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3590780?t=1742506224","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590780/0a48821770d72191b2c79d8c058316129981ee7e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742506224","capsule_imagev5":"https: